IQ Boost is a game with tricky puzzles, tasks and logic tests. 
All the tasks are original and funny! We said ‘NO’ to boring brain training.
Free IQ Boost game features only the best tasks, brainteasers and exercises to train your memory, attention, logic and mindset. 

Only 10% of all the people have an IQ higher than 120. Are you among them? Play IQ Boost - challenge your brain.

Try yourself in solving nontrivial tasks. You will train logical and abstract thinking by solving puzzles and logic tasks. Concentration and memory will be better too. 
Have a good time while training your brain. 

Find out your IQ level. Lower than you thought? Play IQ Boost and you’ll see your IQ is growing. 

Game features:
• Easy to play;
• Nonstandard colourful gameplay;
• Funny answers and solutions;
• Nontrivial challenges for any age;
• Lots of levels;
• Intellectual brain-teaser game.

Remember: obvious solutions might not be not always right...think out of the box and train your brain! Play and prove you are the cleverest!

We offer the latest application for training memory, accelerating the brain, developing intelligence and increasing IQ level. And all this thanks to math problems. Play and develop your concentration! Just do the exercises in the morning, in the afternoon - and you will immediately increase your concentration, productivity, focus.

Our math simulator contains the best tasks for learning, developing logical and abstract thinking, improving memory, increasing the level of motivation:

• puzzles;

• mathematical equations and examples;

• multiplication table;

• exercises for oral counting (addition, subtraction, multiplication, division);

• arithmetic problems;

• intellectual mini-games;

• puzzles.

Brain Training App - Brain Boost is not boring math lessons that we all remember from school. Here, everything is different: each task is interesting, and some even - excitement.

For example, speed puzzles. They need to be solved as quickly as possible in order to invest in the allotted time. Follow the timer, give answers instantly - stimulate your brain, increase its activity! By the way, with each positive result, the difficulty increases, which means that your IQ will grow, and will not remain the same.

Have you ever been offered multiplication and division, addition and subtraction puzzles in math lessons? In our application, you can choose the most interesting tasks for yourself, from simple to complex.

Oral counting develops memory, concentration, thinking speed, mental flexibility and attention. Verbal counting exercises are a super trainer for your brain! memory training - 5 minutes a day and you will notice that any operations in your mind are easier and easier for you every day.

By the way, you can invite your friends to the application and arrange real competitions, compare the results and choose a winner. We are sure that the most motivated will become the leader! Here you can also track your own results, monitor progress, set higher goals.

The math game memory training can be used every morning to increase concentration and focus throughout the day.

A huge plus of this application is that it is completely free, does not require registration and does not require a lot of Internet traffic.

Download the brain training app right now! This is a great cure for boredom, a way to spend your free time with benefit. The application is universal and suitable for everyone - both children and adults.
